cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use flowshape in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "flowshape"
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source web app that turns mathematics into art: 25 deterministic
  pattern generators with every parameter exposed, exported as print-ready
  vector artwork, composed into designed posters, or driven as an
  audio-reactive animation. Pure SVG, no
  backend: the full state lives in the URL, so the same link always renders the
  same artwork. Every pattern ships with its formula, a plain-language
  explanation in English and Spanish, and its own generator source.
type: software
