references:
  - type: website
    title: "The Book of Shapes"
    url: "https://bookofshapes.com"
    notes: >-
      The reference work whose craft standard guided this project: hairline
      strokes, monochrome discipline, and committed compositional registers.
      flowshape is an independent implementation with its own pattern set,
      parameter UI, and bilingual math explanations.
